  "label": "The speaker is mapped onto the party scene",
  "description": "The text 'than i do with a 4 year degree' contrasts the speaker's current situation with their parents'. The party scene, which is associated with the parents' success, is juxtaposed with the speaker's situation, implying that the speaker's life (represented by the party scene) is less successful despite having a 4-year degree. The speaker is implicitly mapped onto the party scene as the visual representation of their current state.",
